SUMMARY:Paper Town Crawfish Boil and Live Music w/ Boukou Groove
DESCRIPTION:Can’t wait to host some of you fine folks at the Paper Town Crawfish boil this Saturday at 4pm! Come get into them while supply’s last! Live Nola funk music and fresh craws straight from the Gulf coast!! See you Saturday! Trays available while supplies last. Grab a Cold drink and a ticket from the bar for your boil. Boil will be prepared on site by the seafood boil specialist from “High Country Boil” \nBoukou Groove- a powerhouse blend of New Orleans soul and funk\, led by Grammy-nominated musicians who bring deep grooves\, rich vocals + world-class musicianship to every stage. boukougroove.com \nMountain Fly is your stop for great gear and the finest fly fishing guides in the Asheville area. Bear Country’s premier outfitter. Stop by and be treated like a human! mountainflyoutfitters.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/boukou-groove/
LOCATION:Doug McElvy’s Mountain Fly Outfitters Canton\, 18 Church St\, Canton\, NC\, 28716
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Canton/Candler,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IMG_0943-e1778204404811.png
