SUMMARY:Alien Music Club Rock & Soul Revue
DESCRIPTION:The Rock & Soul Revue is a collaborative musical exploration into the heartbeat of 50’s\, 60’s & 70’s Rock and Soul music. From Aretha Franklin to Tom Petty\, from Etta James to Steve Miller Band\, this show meets everybody in the middle.\n\nThree quintessential song interpreters\, Reggie Headen\, Jonathan Pearlman and Peggy Ratusz\, join forces to present this nostalgia inducing\, revved up\, effervescent show. Kevin Sanders on keys\, Danny Iannucci on bass\, Justin Watt on drums. A full horn section featuring Dylan Hannan\, Frank Southecorvo and Marty Friedman!\nYou won’t want to miss the opportunity to witness first hand\, up close and personal\, this dynamic show!
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/alien-music-club-rock-soul-revue/
LOCATION:Highland Brewing
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/668602314_1533389875458909_2764772056741523170_n-e1775640833534.jpg
END:VEVENT
